:''Not to be confused with the Item [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]].''
'''Sniper the Recruit''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] increases range, decreases time between attacks and gains the slow ability. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners.

