==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Sniper the Recruit was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Reinforcements (Removed Combo)|Reinforcements]].
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], Sniper the Recruit, [[Rich Cat III (Super Rare Cat)|Rich Cat III]] and [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]] could only be unlocked when "Reinforcements" was part of the current pool.
*Sniper the Heavy's Japanese name, Negolgo, is a portmanteau of ''neko'', meaning "cat", and ''Golgo 13'', the pro assassin and sniper from the [[wikipedia:Golgo 13|manga of the same name]]. Using him even activates a [[Cat Combo]] named [[Thirteen (Combo)|Thirteen]].
**Sniper the Deadeye's age of 31 is just 13 reversed. In fact, his Japanese name is Negolgo 31!
*Sniper the Deadeye's description references Craigslist, an online marketplace for goods and services which is infamous for its questionable reliability.

